rac{b}{a}.\n$$\n\n- The product of the solutions is given by\n\n$$\n{x}_{1}\\cdot {x}_{2}=\\frac{c}{a}.\n$$\n\nFor the given quadratic equation, we have\n\n$$\na=1,\\,b=146,\\,c=-8\\,395.\n$$\n\nTherefore, the product of the solutions is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{c}{a} & =\\frac{(-8\\,395)}{1}=-8\\,395.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533851 true] [17592186255473 1000 #edb/ref 17592186255474 13194139533851 true] [17592186255473 1000 #edb/ref 17592186255475 13194139533851 true] [17592186255473 1000 #edb/ref 17592186255476 13194139533851 true] [17592186255473 1000 #edb/ref 17592186255477 13194139533851 true] [17592186255473 1000 #edb/ref 17592186255478 13194139533851 true] [17592186255473 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139533851 true] [17592186255473 1041 "selection" 13194139533851 true] [17592186255473 1104 #edb/ref 17592186255477 13194139533851 true] [17592186255473 1110 #uuid "11eda378-9d35-5206-8052-158756b70caf" 13194139533851 true] [17592186255474 1034 "8\\,395" 13194139533851 true] [17592186255474 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533851 true] [17592186255474 1111 #uuid "c70e1173-a89f-5d18-9a13-ca9b6dfa78c9" 13194139533851 true] [17592186255475 1034 "(-2)\\cdot 8\\,395" 13194139533851 true] [17592186255475 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533851 true] [17592186255475 1111 #uuid "20046d4e-5836-5fae-b719-fd9691d34151" 13194139533851 true] [17592186255476 1034 "\\frac{146}{2}" 13194139533851 true] [17592186255476 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533851 true] [17592186255476 1111 #uuid "390abde6-1d1e-547d-b8bf-eb4b212eba66" 13194139533851 true] [17592186255477 1034 "-8\\,395" 13194139533851 true] [17592186255477 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533851 true] [17592186255477 1111 #uuid "e612dcc1-a5a7-5eb7-97a8-cd782c2c87ea" 13194139533851 true] [17592186255478 1034 "\\frac{-8\\,395}{146}" 13194139533851 true] [17592186255478 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533851 true] [17592186255478 1111 #uuid "52718b2c-82f8-5ba5-9b8a-5d80011ed86c" 13194139533